CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.13
--------------------------

SIGNIFICANT USER-VISIBLE CHANGES

    o Move optional dependency installation to container setup, using the
      requested analysis inputs and genome. Package functions only check
      dependencies and provide installation instructions.

    o Ship the Dockerfile, CLI, and container setup scripts in inst/docker.

    o Document external tool installation and Windows limitations in INSTALL.

    o Replace donttest examples with small runnable examples and wrap long
      vignette prose and comments.

BUG FIXES

    o Select Circos example regions on the chromosomes represented in the
      bundled data and allow vignette plotting errors to surface.

